      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Shorts - image to video (Wan 2.2 14B)\n\n**Output:** 480x832 portrait, 81 frames, 16 fps (~5 s), silent.\n\n- Load a portrait image that already matches 9:16. The workflow uses a high-noise and a low-noise 4-step model in two passes.\n- **Width** and **Height** are 480 x 832 for speed. The workflow notes also list 576x1024 and 720x1280; those are heavier.\n- For a prompt-only clip use the **Wan 2.2 5B** workflow instead.\n- Upscale the result with **SeedVR2** for a 1080p-class upload.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Shorts - how to use"
    },
